' === Sequence Diagram: Ajukan Reservasi ===
actor Pegawai
participant "Form Reservasi" as ReservasiForm
participant Sistem

Pegawai -> ReservasiForm : Buka halaman ajukan reservasi
Pegawai -> ReservasiForm : Isi data lengkap
Pegawai -> ReservasiForm : Klik tombol "Ajukan Reservasi"
ReservasiForm -> Sistem : Validasi & simpan data
Sistem -> Pegawai : Tampilkan notifikasi reservasi dikirim
